.env
spacetrack.env
eoAccess.env
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
~$*

# Working backup -- 0_tools/bugs.py writes it on every save
bugsDB.xlsx.bak

# Databases are never committed: each is rebuilt or kept current by its own
# ingestion job, the live server keeps its own, and committed copies would
# republish Space-Track data. The exceptions are the two reference
# databases, built on the laptop from files the server doesn't have and
# carried to it by the deploy (dbRefactorPlan.md, decision D).
# ingestionDBs/ is the folder's old name (scripts/dbPaths.py); kept here
# until every working copy has been renamed to databases/.
databases/*
!databases/ingestionGroundSegment.db
!databases/ingestionSkyCatalogue.db
ingestionDBs/*
!ingestionDBs/groundSegmentAssets.db

# API snapshots from 0_tools/apiSnapshot.py -- large, regenerated on demand
0_testReports/apiSnapshots/

# Output of the Enterprise crew agents (Rand, Spock): working documents, never committed or deployed
enterpriseCrewOutput/
